Cell["\<\
The choice below for the momenta and the ordering of the particles in the \
process is equivalent to the correct
ordering for computing the effective vertex for the UFO format:
0 \[Rule]3, with {} \[Rule]{-F[9],F[9],V[4]} and all the momenta set as \
outgoing ({} \[Rule] {p1,p2,p3}).
However the choice below produces nicer diagrams.\
\>", "Text",
